note <Keyed-hash message authentication (HMAC). The clean uniform interface; the per-env native implementation is selected at build time and hidden. The interface is async to stay uniform with the rest of cryptography (some platforms only expose crypto asynchronously).>

load @cluesurf/base/code/native/cryptography/hmac
  find hmac-sha256
  find hmac-sha512

task sha256
  mark async
  take key, like text
  take data, like text
  like text
  send back
    call hmac-sha256
      read key
      read data
      wait true

task sha512
  mark async
  take key, like text
  take data, like text
  like text
  send back
    call hmac-sha512
      read key
      read data
      wait true
